  "body": "It would be useful if there was a way to read and also update the dirty flag for input elements from Javascript.\r\n\r\nOur use case is we provide a Chrome extension that users can use to programmatically modify the contents of <input> elements. We would like these changes to the elements to have the same effect as if the user manually edited the element.\r\n\r\nHowever, programmatic modifications to the content of an input element via JavaScript will not set the dirty flag. Because of this, we would like some way to manually set it ourselves.",
